---

<Layout title="Level 15 Fold 15 — Prima & Timo Lore Guide">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-20 px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-cyan-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="w-[350px] h-[350px] bg-purple-500/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-800/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-950/50">
      <span>🤖 LEVEL 15 &bull; FOLD 15 &bull; ARCHIVAL LORE GUIDE</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight text-white">
      Prima Et Timo: <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-teal-300 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">The Chronological Lore Guide</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      An eons-spanning sci-fi chronicle detailing Machine Awakening, Civilizational Hand-Offs, and the enduring bonds across 34 Ages.
    </p>

    <!-- Master Philosophy Banner -->
    <div class="mt-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-950/80 via-slate-900/90 to-purple-950/80 border border-cyan-500/40 p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-xl backdrop-blur-md">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 font-bold block mb-1">FOUNDATIONAL METAPHYSICAL LAW</span>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">"Same Core, Different House"</h2>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Different forms, different bodies, different civilizations, and different ages share the same emotional truths. The "house" changes; the "core" remains.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-cyan-900/60 flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-300">
        <span>Monkey</span> &rarr; <span>Human</span> &rarr; <span>Machine / AI</span> &rarr; <span>Future Civilizations</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quick Nav Anchor Links -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 mb-12 sticky top-4 z-40">
    <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-800 p-3 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-md flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 shadow-xl">
      <a href="#sheets-showcase" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">🖼️ Master Sheets</a>
      <a href="#relics-artifacts" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">📿 Key Artifacts</a>
      <a href="#mechanics" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">⚙️ Mechanics</a>
      <a href="#saga-acts" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">📖 Acts I-IV</a>
      <a href="#faction-codex" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">👥 Faction Dossiers</a>
      <a href="#chassis-archive" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">🎨 Visual Specs</a>
      <a href="#mysteries" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-cyan-950 hover:text-cyan-300 border border-slate-700/50 hover:border-cyan-800 transition">🕵️ Open Mysteries</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURED MASTER CANON CHARACTER SHEETS SHOWCASE -->
  <section id="sheets-showcase" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-900">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-800/60">
        OFFICIAL VISUAL ARCHIVE
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mt-4">Master Character Sheets</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-2">Official 4K canon reference packs for the lead protagonists of Level 15 Fold 15.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- Prima Master Sheet Card -->
      <div class="bg-slate-900/90 border border-cyan-900/60 rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-cyan-500/80 transition group shadow-xl">
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-300 bg-cyan-950 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-cyan-800/50">Core 2 &bull; Organic Glitch</span>
